From: Luan Rafael Carneiro <luan.r@variscite.com>
Subject: [PATCH] imx_signer: allow five FIT loadables

An encrypted i.MX8M FIT has U-Boot, its DTB, ATF, OP-TEE, and the
DEK-blob placeholder, in addition to the FIT FDT itself. Reserve one
more image slot so the signer does not write beyond g_images.

---
 inc/fdt.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/inc/fdt.h b/inc/fdt.h
index 2eaec86..7862ff4 100644
--- a/inc/fdt.h
+++ b/inc/fdt.h
@@ -210 +210 @@
-#define NUM_IMGS 0x5
+#define NUM_IMGS 0x6
